### Requests for the IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code REST Client.
### Start everything with `docker compose up --build`, then run these top to bottom.

@api = http://localhost:8080
@adminKey = local-admin-key-change-me

### 1. Create an application (copy "apiKey" from the response into @appKey below)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/admin/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "billing-service", "rateLimitPerSecond": 50}

###
@appKey = whk_paste-the-key-here

### 2. Register an endpoint (the demo receiver, as seen from inside docker compose)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/endpoints
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"url": "http://demo-receiver:9090/flaky?fail=0.5", "description": "fails half the time", "eventTypes": ["invoice.*"]}

### 3. Publish an event (run it twice: the second time you get 200 + Idempotent-Replayed)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: invoice-42-paid

{"eventType": "invoice.paid", "payload": {"invoiceId": "inv_42", "amountCents": 4999}}

### 4. Event with the status of each delivery
GET {{api}}/api/v1/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### 5. Failed deliveries ("dead letters")
GET {{api}}/api/v1/deliveries?status=FAILED
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### 6. Attempt log of one delivery
GET {{api}}/api/v1/deliveries/1/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### 7. Retry one delivery by hand
POST {{api}}/api/v1/deliveries/1/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### 8. Signing secret (the receiver needs it to verify signatures)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/endpoints/1/secret
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### 9. Rotate the secret (old one keeps working for 24h)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/endpoints/1/secret/rotate
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### 10. Endpoint stats: deliveries by status, success rate and latency of the last 24h
GET {{api}}/api/v1/endpoints/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### 11. Replay every failed delivery of an endpoint
POST {{api}}/api/v1/endpoints/1/replay-failed
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### 12. Totals for the application
GET {{api}}/api/v1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### 13. Prometheus metrics (admin key)
GET {{api}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
